  {
   "id": "outpath-229007@1.1.2",
   "gameId": "outpath-229007",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1.2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-28T21:11:02.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey! David here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Outpath v1.1.2 is out! A small update that fixes joining a friend's game and the resolution on ultrawide screens. I will be working on improving the controller support.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Multiplayer (experimental)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Some of you told me that your friend joined your game and appeared in the sea, with no island, nothing unlocked and the buildings in black.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The reason: in big games, the world was too big to be sent over Steam. That is fixed, and the world is now compressed before it is sent, so joining is also faster.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "While joining, the loading screen now shows whose game you are joining and stays until the world is ready, instead of an empty sea. If it never arrives, you go back to the main menu with a message.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You and your friend both need v1.1.2 to play together.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for reporting it, and thanks to the player who sent me their save, it helped a lot!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "About the cover art",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Some of you said the old cover art of Outpath was made with AI, and you were right. I had uploaded those images to Steam only to preview how they looked with colors, style, etc. Later, when I published a build with some fixes, I forgot they were still there and they were published with it. Then I couldn't put the old images back because of problems with their resolution, so they stayed. The new cover art was made by my publisher's artist. The game itself was made during 2022 and 2023 without any generative AI just to clarify.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Screen resolution",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The Screen Resolution button now also goes back to your monitor's resolution, so ultrawide screens can use theirs again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Joining a friend is faster and shows a loading screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Fixed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Friends joining a big game no longer land in the sea.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The resolution button now includes your monitor's resolution.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you like my work and want to support me, I really appreciate a review of the game! ːluvː ːwinter2019happybulbː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Check the Official Discord where I am active.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "David ːwinter2019happyyulː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
