  {
   "id": "outpath-229007@1.0.7",
   "gameId": "outpath-229007",
   "displayName": "Update 1.0.7",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2023-10-22T06:39:33.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A big patch fixing a lot of things, I hope it will make Outpath a better experience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Change Log",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "+ Added new sprites to the 8 letters.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "+ Optimization skill replaced by another new skill: Chlorophyll Extraction.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "+ New UI for Crop Plots.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Fixed achievements: Knowledge, My diet, One Punch Man.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Novice builder, Skilled builder, Expert builder and Architect achievements decreased requirements and fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Icecream now has an effect.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Synergies dissapearing fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Electrifiers now charge builds more often.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Buffed aqua butterfly spawn rate.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Fixed some prop names.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* You can craft now Luslite and Dimber in the Spirit Forge.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Break particles option fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Buffed again iron deposits.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Dark Sorcery Table won't transform into a workbench when loading the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Old tier tools and artifacts will no longer appear in the inventory.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Bird companion will appear once you read a letter.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Bird now eats more types of foods.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Decreased Bony Trophies from 15 to 10 creatures.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Summoner skill price fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Decreased price of first expansions in the Amberpath biome.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Changed devourer UI so now indicates how much Health needs to charge itself.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* You can't no longer use Capture Nets having 0 in the inventory.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Duplication skill fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Fixed some misspelling.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Changed Island Eater sprite and increased cooldown to 10s.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Fixed some UIs staying after dismantle.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* You can't no longer record a gif while changing the name of a Teleporter.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Can't no longer save inside the cave (this was triggering the permanent night bug and a couple more bugs).: Next thing I will work on is Cloud save.: Much love to all who support me! ːluvː: https://store.steampowered.com/app/2237970/Outpath/: Have a nice day/night! ːwinter2019happyyulː: David",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
